Error [E0925]: `#Task`/`#Every(…)` only mark a top-level function
  --> tests/ui/schedule_task_on_method.jet:9:5
    |
  9 |     #Task
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: a task is `jetpack run <name>`'s unit of work — a method has no free-standing name to invoke, so it can't be one (D-JPK-TASKRUN1).
 Fix: move this function to the top level, beside `fn run()`.
